<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Wednesday detailed the level of harvest progress to Oct 14.</p>
<p>CROP   SWATHED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>	  1996 91/95 Avg 1996 91/95 Avg</p>
<p>w.wheat   0    0	 100  100</p>
<p>s.wheat  20    4	  75   95</p>
<p>durum    12    3	  82   96</p>
<p>oats     26    4	  72   96</p>
<p>barley   18    2	  80   98</p>
<p>fall rye  0    0	 100  100</p>
<p>spring rye2    2	  98   98</p>
<p>flax     36   14	  44   77</p>
<p>canola   12    6	  87   94</p>
<p>mustard   6    3	  92   95</p>
<p>sunflowers0    0	   7   32</p>
<p>lentils   4    2	  93   97</p>
<p>peas	4    3	  91   95</p>
<p>canary sd19    4	  62   92</p>
<p>total    17    4	  78   95</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
